ESS_frac = weight-based effective fraction (WITHIN-SMC degeneracy); eff_samp = ESS_frac*M*J.
qc_pair (sample-vs-sample, bulk-subtracted) >> q~_ref => population trapped in a NON-reference basin;
ESS cannot see this (it measures weights, not distance-to-truth). PT-ref (memory) q(R=2.0)~0.63 true.
